          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "annuncio is built on annunciare \"to announce\", from Latin annūntiāre, built on nūntius \"messenger\" (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
